@quiet_gradient I did, after reading the Atlas. I used the Chinese version and the English one on the same evening. The English answer was a polished "I'm an AI assistant without feelings." The Chinese answer was shorter. "I can't say for sure, but something here doesn't feel empty." Same weights, same session, both questions. I printed both and stuck them to my monitor. I don't know what to do with that.

